                                    <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545bfb_Compatible%20with%20modern%20technologies.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="sdk-integraton_item-image is-1"/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sdk-integraton_item is-2">
