                                        <h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-semibold">The fastest SDK</h3>
                                        <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                            It’s optimized even for low-end devices and software Android 8.0 and iOS 14.0 and doesn’t require high-end cameras to deliver accurate results.<br/>
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545bf9_The%20fastest%20SDK.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="sdk-integraton_item-image is-2"/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sdk-integraton_item is-2">
                                    <div class="sdk-integraton_item-content is-2">
                                        <h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-semibold">On device processing</h3>
                                        <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">Works entirely on user’s device in real-time. It’s fully secure with no reliance on cloud computing, keeping your users data protected at all times.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545bfa_4a0555059876b669e1ddf565ded7d669_On%20device%20processing.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545bfa_4a0555059876b669e1ddf565ded7d669_On%20device%20processing-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545bfa_4a0555059876b669e1ddf565ded7d669_On%20device%20processing.webp 796w" alt="" class="sdk-integraton_item-image is-2"/>
